WEBVTT

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.130
Nishizawa-san

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.060
Yukishiro-san...

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.440
Suddenly something strange came 
from way out beyond the sky...

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.590
When I followed what it said,

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.540
Yukishiro-san appeared with 
something similar to mine...

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.780
Than we were attacked by 
a roller coaster monster,

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.480
and before we knew it, 
we had both transformed,

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.270
and we were fighting the 
roller coaster monster.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.560
What was it that came to my house?

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.760
Who was it that attacked us?

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.310
I don't believe I transformed 
into something else.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.570
Was I dreaming?

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.680
According to the votes,

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.790
the class representative for 
the second year Sakura group

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.610
will be Yukishiro-san

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.610
Thank you, everybody.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.600
"Tami is like the chrysanthemum.

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.670
" I love chrysanthemums..."

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:11.860
Hey there!

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.680
"Tami said, 'Hey there!'"

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.000
What was that?

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.990
Hey there!

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:18.970
It's him!

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.920
What's wrong, Misumi-san?

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:22.600
Nothing.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.360
Continue...

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.610
Y-yes!

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:27.880
"Then Tami..."

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.370
Hey! Hey! Hey there!

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.040
Misumi-san...!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:34.990
What am I going to do? 
I don't believe this.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:37.980
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:40.780
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:43.610
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:47.890
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.860
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.730
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.630
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.530
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:01.130
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:06.940
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:09.040
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:12.810
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.810
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:19.380
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.550
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.420
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:31.700
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:32.600
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:35.300
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.010
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.570
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:45.640
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.820
Jyaku-King, sir...

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:02.460
I've located the those two creatures 
who escaped form the Field of Light.

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.790
You did?

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:08.770
Then why don't we have the Prism Stones here?

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:12.070
There was unexpected interference.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.700
That's not what I asked you!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:16.770
The Prism Stones...

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.140
Of the seven we have five in our possession.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:27.580
Pisard... Your duty is to get the remaining 
two that those creatures ran away with.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.550
I understand.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:31.720
In order for me to continue 
to exist in this world,

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:35.820
I need all the power that the 
Prism Stones bring forth.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:41.000
When I have all seven of those 
stones, I will live on forever.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:47.240
Then Dotsuku Zone will 
take over all the worlds,

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.730
and we will control them 
all from corner to corner.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:53.480
Go, Pisard! For the sake of our future.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.320
"GIVE ME A BREAK! THE CITY 
TARGETED BY DARKNESS"

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.410
What did you want in the 
middle of my class anyway?

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:18.550
I'm hungry, Nagisa. Give me breakfast.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.870
Are you kidding? I'm not your wife.

00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.840
And besides, you should show a 
little respect when you address me.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.820
Please, Nagisa-sama.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:30.140
Dear Sister Nagisa...

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:32.570
Princess Nagisa...

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.480
Be quiet!

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.290
Stop that!

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:39.240
If I don't eat, I'll die mepo.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.760
If that happens...

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:43.340
I'll haunt you mepo.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.970
Stop it already.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.670
I'll stop, so feed me mepo.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.970
But I don't have anything to eat.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:53.430
Swipe the caretaking card.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.890
Card?

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:58.360
If you don't swipe the 
card, I can't eat mepo.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.770
Which card?

00:05:02.770 --> 00:05:03.680
Omp mepo.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.530
Omp? What is that?

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:10.210
Those cared are all residents 
of the Field of Light mepo.

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.000
They all came to take care of me mepo.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.660
This?

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.270
Wrong one mepo.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:17.860
Then this one...?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.850
No mepo.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.890
Not that one mepo.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:24.840
What about this one?

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.640
That's Omp mepo.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.070
Is this it?

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.030
Hurry, and swipe that card mepo.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:37.210
Good morning, Mepple, sir.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:43.350
This morning, I prepared a 
bacon and lettuce sandwich.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.630
Looks delicious!

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:46.520
Reject!

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.530
I want to eat rice this morning mepo.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:51.110
Is that right?

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:53.360
You're so spoiled.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.740
Did you say something mepo?

00:05:54.740 --> 00:05:57.460
No... How about this?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.410
The best thing in the morning 
is rice and miso soup mepo.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.400
I'm so glad i was born Japanese mepo.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:04.880
Who's Japanese?

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.450
What is all this energy anyway?

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.810
If you take them one by 
one the quality goes down,

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.400
but I can feel a little power 
coming out of certain places.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.190
That's not the only thing...

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:34.240
but there's an immeasurable amount 
of happiness and sadness, anger,

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.980
and hatred spiraling into 
an overflow of power.

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:41.470
It's like... like a giant smelting furnace.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.670
I might just be able to give 
Jyaku-King a nice present.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.640
Is this yours, Yukishiro-san?

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.210
It's one of my best inventions.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.150
Watch this.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.190
When you put this sugar water in here...

00:07:04.010 --> 00:07:05.090
Is it okay?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:11.500
It's almost ready.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.700
See? The candy is ready.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:18.080
All that noise just for this?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.890
You might think it's nothing much, but...

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:21.350
What?

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:22.300
Duck!

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:30.390
I'll have to make it all over again.

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:31.960
Again?

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.640
Yukishiro-san...?

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:36.990
I feel Mipple close by mepo!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:40.540
Mipple!

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:44.630
Mipple... Mipple... Mipple... 
Where's Mipple mepo?

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:46.540
She's taking a nap right now.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.680
After I turned myself into this mepo...

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:55.030
I wasted my energy.
I'm tired mepo.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.290
He must have really wanted to see Mipple.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.710
You mean like true love?

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:05.670
But it's a real problem because 
he keeps talking during class.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.390
What about the sleeping card?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.790
Sleeping card?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:12.210
Was there such a card?

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.830
Which one is it?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:14.670
This one.

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.910
Oh, no!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.600
I'm not sleepy now mepo.

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:18.600
Be quiet!

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:31.760
You're right.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.020
He went to sleep.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:35.680
Let's put them to sleep when we're in school.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:36.700
Good idea.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.510
So what is it?

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.290
You wanted to talk to me, didn't you?

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:43.760
I don't want to do that anymore.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.400
You mean what happened yesterday?

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:49.600
Even if I told my parents, 
they wouldn't believe me.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:52.540
To being with, I can't take 
care of this little thing.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:53.690
I see...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.690
Don't tell me you're...?

00:08:56.690 --> 00:09:00.610
I think it's fate that we've 
been blessed with this.

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:04.510
Does that mean that you really believe that

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.530
the two of us can protect the Earth together?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:12.830
Nothing as wild as that but it 
seems kind of interesting to me.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:13.800
Don't you realize...?

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.060
We could have both been killed!

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:20.300
That's what makes it interesting.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.530
I don't know what's going on!

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:25.780
We managed to make it through 
somehow the last time,

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:28.990
but if that's monster appears out 
of nowhere again, and attacks us...!

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:33.660
That's probably from the Boy's Division.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:38.260
It's those guys from the soccer team.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.520
What are they thinking?

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:42.770
Hey, you guys! Where do think you're...?

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:43.720
Were you hurt?

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.300
Sorry about that...

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:54.150
It was just another one 
of Fuji-P's crazy kicks!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:54.760
Apologize!

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:57.090
I'm sorry. Are you sure you're okay?

00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.530
Please be more careful from now on.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:12.490
Where did all her anger disappear to anyway?

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:14.450
How about this one?

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:22.040
It has so much power that it will 
clean your rugs and floors thoroughly.

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.250
Thank you very much.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:57.780
Why did my face get so hot earlier?

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:01.070
Are you thinking about what we're 
having for dinner tonight mepo?

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:05.530
I'm not you! Just leave me alone!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:07.560
I can't do that mepo.

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.510
We're in this together for the long haul...

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:12.490
I told you it's not just up to you, didn't I?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:16.330
Nagisa?  Shall I tell you 
about my hometown mepo?

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:17.820
I really don't want to hear about it.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:22.220
Please! I want you to hear it mepo.

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.030
Okay. Okay... I'll listen 
if it'll make you happy.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.350
Very good mepo.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.700
You always get teary-eyed when 
you don't get what you want.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:32.730
The place where we lived is 
called the Field of light mepo.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:34.140
The Field of Light?

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:37.040
It was always covered 
with flowers blooming...

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.690
It was a really beautiful place mepo.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:43.670
The hearts of the residents of 
the Field of Light were filled

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.920
with courage, hope, and justice, 
and we lived happy lives mepo.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.450
Until one day, an evil 
force from somewhere came,

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:55.280
and began to swallow up the Field of Light.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.860
That evil force is called Dotsuku Zone.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.100
Fearing that Dotsuku Zone would completely 
annihilate the Field of Light,

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:05.540
The Queen and Senior entrusted 
Mipple, the Princess of Hope,

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.700
and me, the Chosen Guardian,

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.950
with the Prism Stones, 
and helped us to escape.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.440
Prism Stones?

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:16.900
They're the stones of life that Mepple 
and I have been entrusted with mipo.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.560
That's what Dotsuku Zone is after mipo.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:22.260
What in the world do these stones...?

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:23.280
Honoka...?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.230
What is it, Grandmother?

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:30.200
Who were you talking to just now?

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:33.660
No one... I must have been talking to myself.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.560
Is that right?

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.180
Is that what you were doing?

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:43.640
Never mind that... Have you been in 
the storeroom in the yard lately?

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.220
No...

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:50.500
You haven't? That's okay then.

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:00.050
It's time to get this show on the road.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.490
Unleash your ghostly anger. Zakenna!

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:06.680
And with your sinister heart, show them how 
terrifying the power of darkness can be!

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.900
Get up, Zakenna!

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.880
Zakenna!

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:29.350
Suck up all the energy.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.180
That's the way... Suck it all up.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.760
Let's go, Zakenna!

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.730
The evil forces from Dotsuku Zone 
are about to attack again mepo.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.450
So I want you to fight together with us mepo.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:14:03.520
But you didn't have to choose an ordinary 
girl like me to do something that important.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:07.220
At this rate, this place will 
end up like the Field of Light.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:09.910
I wonder what's going on.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.400
What in the world happened anyway?

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.630
<i>I have a news flash.</i>

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.080
<i>Presently, the area 
surrounding the Jonan region</i>

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:24.690
<i>is experiencing power outages 
from one area to the next...</i>

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.880
<i>The people are in a state of panic.</i>

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:33.870
It's those evil forces 
from Dotsuku Zone mepo.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:34.330
You're kidding!

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.560
Nagisa! We have to do something mepo.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:37.780
This is a job for Pretty Cure mepo.

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:39.390
But...

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:42.470
Mipple has probably realized what's going 
on, and is heading for the site right now mepo.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.280
Hurry!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.250
Really?

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.730
I'm home! It's crazy out there, Sis.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.930
All the traffic lights are out, and...

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:54.300
Where are you going?

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:55.670
Does it matter?

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.360
Where are you going?

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:59.170
Where? Where?

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.840
Be quiet!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:02.570
I'm sorry! I give up!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:03.880
I give up!

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:18.640
I can feel them mepo...

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.400
Nagisa... They're close by mepo.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:27.840
What's wrong, Misumi-san?

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.010
Shiho! Rina!

00:15:31.670 --> 00:15:32.600
We have to help them.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.150
Let's go up to the roof.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:37.880
You're...?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:41.350
Well! Well! I knew you'd come.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:44.360
We don't have time to deal with you now.

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:47.120
I really wish you would.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.010
Go, Zakenna!

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.860
Zakenna!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.930
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.430
Now you've made me mad!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:02.900
Transform mepo!

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:04.400
Yukishiro-san...!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.310
Okay! Swipe the cards mepo!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.540
Duel Aurora Wave!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:07.950
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.800
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:14.480
Together, we are Pretty Cure!

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:17.780
Servants of the power of darkness!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.970
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:23.450
Just as I thought... These two are the 
legendary duo from the Field of Light...

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:27.080
